msgid "Disable \"&window.open()\""
msgstr ""

#: jsopts.cpp:127
msgid ""
"If you disable this option, Konqueror will stop interpreting the <i>window.op"
"en()</i> JavaScript command. This is useful if you regulary visit sites that "
"make extensive use of this command to pop up ad banners.<br><br><b>Note:</b> "
"Disabling this option might also break certain sites that require <i>window.o"
"pen()</i> for proper operation. Use this feature carefully!"
msgstr ""

